{"version":1,"key":"card:253","content":{"id":253,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"111f26f4-68ce-4583-a625-313400656548","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数组的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"concat"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法的作用是将两个数组拼接起来，然后返回一个新的数组"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"fc62b332-b64a-4bd1-b0a7-f9672b2cedb7","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ad214c8c-7a92-403a-b658-4bfa866c972e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let colors1 = [\"red\", \"green\"];\nlet colors2 = colors1.concat([\"white\", \"blue\"]);\n\nconsole.log(colors2); // [ 'red', 'green', 'white', 'blue' ]","collabId":"c139b137-35a6-4ea5-a596-69c68ec3f776","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c32a31f4-d10e-4020-bd36-96a98fcfbf1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"concat"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 除了可以接受数组作为参数，还可以接受非数组参数"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"4dde4aa8-f60a-455d-9b0b-b4a2bd1dbcc1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f2daec56-3351-423a-ac17-d6c807abe76f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let colors1 = [\"red\", \"green\"];\nlet colors2 = colors1.concat([\"white\", \"blue\"], \"pink\");\n\nconsole.log(colors2); // [ 'red', 'green', 'white', 'blue', 'pink' ]","collabId":"5978e475-abfa-498c-b87a-597196b6dc24","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fcf69593-bc10-4ee4-bbff-349b3ce8a0b0","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\"pink\""},{"type":"formatted","text":" 作为非数组参数传入，成为了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"colors2"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组的第五个元素。为什么数组参数被区别对待(数组参数为什么不是整体拼接到数组中)，这是因为 JavaScript 规定了数组会被自动的被分割为独立的元素。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"94aed51c-77dc-4a6e-8859-c5ee55697f26","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们传递一个对象时，该对象是作为一个整体拼接，还是分割为多个元素拼接，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol.isConcatSpreadable"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来决定。能被自动分割的对象满足两个条件："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"3c0596d1-09c2-4275-a317-8ed640e485b9","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"dd59d65d-0d28-41a8-94df-747233c1bf68","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f82d8651-86e4-4564-8795-7cc7660b3c4d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"length"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性(根据 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"length"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性决定分割为多少个元素)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d61d36f2-65a5-428f-ae27-6b3590e8a6c3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fa82b610-c840-4c79-abf8-c26f1c7dbc97","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol.isConcatSpreadable"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"true"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cdcbe14a-2840-46fe-bdb9-82fd404c6d48","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果满足条件，那么就会将对象中的数字属性分割为一项项进行拼接"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"1b1bec72-fbc7-4049-81bf-05100fb35fe4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"a17b7c5b-5ab1-4f25-9f2b-501c112eb676","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const colors1 = [\"red\", \"green\"];\nconst obj = {\n  0: \"blue\",\n  1: \"white\",\n  length: 2,\n  name: \"obj\",\n  [Symbol.isConcatSpreadable]: true,\n};\n\nconst colors2 = colors1.concat(obj);\nconsole.log(colors2); // [ 'red', 'green', 'blue', 'white' ]","collabId":"d8711dd4-96e0-4960-8a0c-11834e26459f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"],"createTime":1690986703621,"updateTime":1743303640412,"linkedCards":[{"id":249,"target":{"key":"card:249","type":"card","id":249},"summary":"Symbol 是 ES6 引入的一种新的原始类型，类型的值唯一的，每个被创建出来的 Symbol 变量都是不同的，这是 Symbol 这种数据类型最大的特点，常常用于作为对象的属性，以防止被不正确篡改。 Symbol 不能通过字面量来进行创...","tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640412}}